    given-names: Ibrahim
    affiliation: Bina Nusantara University
  - family-names: Bangun
    given-names: Salsabila Rafa Ginta Beru
    affiliation: Bina Nusantara University
  - family-names: Ahmad
    given-names: Fazila Azizah
    affiliation: Bina Nusantara University
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ibrairsyad17/open-transit-data-warehouse-preliminary-study"
abstract: >-
  Appendix A of the thesis proposal "Designing and Building a Data Warehouse for Monitoring
  Public Transport Data Quality Based on GTFS-Realtime with the Kimball Lifecycle Methodology"
  (Bina Nusantara University, 2026), with the data and scripts behind it. The 330 official,
  active and keyless GTFS-Realtime vehicle-position feeds of the Mobility Database were
  downloaded and counted four times in October 2026, and five feeds that looked broken were
  checked by hand against their agencies' schedules.
keywords:
  - GTFS-Realtime
  - data quality
  - public transport
  - Mobility Database
  - data warehouse
